    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Pulitzer Prize-winning photojournalist Lynsey Addario struggles to maintain family life in London while repeatedly risking her life on the frontlines, focusing on how women around the world are affected by war, disaster, political conflict &amp; oppressive regimes. Heart-stopping scenes and astonishing front-page photos are highlights of this National Geographic film, featuring moving accounts of the [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
